# What platform.Dockerfile may read (step 2.95, record 101): nothing but the paths let
# back in below. Docker reads this file instead of .dockerignore (the tracker's) because
# it sits beside platform.Dockerfile with its name. The last rule that matches a path wins.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.base.json
!apps/web
!apps/worker
!packages
!scripts/web.mjs
!scripts/web-listen.mjs
!supabase/site.json
!supabase/migrations
# Never, even inside the paths above: installed packages, a local build, tests, and any
# settings file.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/.env
**/.env.*
